; claude: a small Emacs Lisp (libs/languages/README.md): Lisp (the
; values, and printing them), Lisp_read (the reader), Lisp_eval (eval
; and apply, dynamic scope, the state threaded as a value; a host adds
; its functions and special forms), Lisp_prelude (the macros written
; in Lisp: when, dolist...). TinyEmacs (apps/devtools/) is its host:
; appkits/editor's Emacs_editor gives it a buffer to change.
;
; Pure OCaml, no Playground. A private library, installed as part of
; elm_playground.
(library
 (name lisp)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
